<title>USA: Group raises stake in Cliffs Drilling.</title>
<headline>Group raises stake in Cliffs Drilling.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Appalosa Management L.P. said Tuesday it raised its stake in Cliffs Drilling Co to 825,000 common shares or 11.14 percent from 8.59 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include a net of 155,100 common shares bought between Sept 11 and October 10 at prices ranging from $29 to $35.72 per share.</p>
</text>
